+Chromium 147 compatibility patch placeholder.
+
+Purpose:
+- Keep a tracked, apply-able patch artifact in-tree so build scripts can
+  deterministically execute the same compatibility step on new machines.
+
+How to replace with real content:
+1) On a known-good Chromium 147 checkout:
+     git -C "$CHROMIUM_SRC" diff -- <compat files> > \
+       "$CEF_DIR/patch/chromium147-compat.patch"
+2) Keep this patch scoped to compatibility-only edits.
+3) Re-run tools/claude/build.sh (it auto-applies this patch).
+
+This README file exists only to make the placeholder patch syntactically valid.
